  "title": "See the big picture with goal rollups",
  "product": "Goals",
  "status": "rolling_out",
  "description": "Teams with deep hierarchies or cascading OKRs can now get a more accurate view of their progress. By rolling up progress from sub-goals, you ensure that every level of your hierarchy reflects the actual work being done, giving leaders better visibility into overall success. To get started with this change: Go to a goal\n\tSelect the Settings icon next to the progress field.\n\tChoose Sub-goals from the rollup type options.\n\tSelect Save to update the progress calculation.",
